    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Churches Estate Agents are delighted to present No. 45 Park Road, Glenageary Heights to the market. A beautifully maintained three bedroom family home offering comfort and quality. This ideal starter home presents a rare opportunity to acquire a home with class from bygone years in an established neighbourhood combining immediate comfort with excellent scope to create a larger family home in the years ahead. \r\n\r\nBuilt in the mid 1980s and extending to approximately 79 sq. m. (850 sq. ft.) this attractive home has been lovingly cared for throughout the years. It has well proportioned accommodation, generous plot of ground and potential to extend (S.P.P.) similar to neighbouring properties make it an excellent opportunity for first time buyers, growing families and those looking to downsize without compromise.\r\n\r\nA mature evergreen hedge provides privacy to the front while the low-maintenance driveway offers ample off street parking for up to 3- 4 cars. Stepping inside a welcoming entrance hall with understairs storage leads to a bright and spacious living room overlooking the front garden, complete with a feature gas fireplace and marble stone surround. Double doors open into the once formal dining room creating an ideal space for both everyday family living and entertaining. To the rear, the kitchen is fitted with storage presses and integrated electric cooking appliances while a breakfast area provides a comfortable setting for casual or light dining.\r\nUpstairs, natural light floods the landing through a gable end window. The accommodation comprises three well proportioned bedrooms including two generous doubles and a spacious single all benefiting from built-in wardrobes and carpet flooring. A fully tiled family bathroom completes this first floor.\r\n\r\nThe rear garden is a true highlight of the property. Wonderfully private and not overlooked this low-maintenance outdoor space enjoys sunshine from morning through to late afternoon with a patio perfect for outdoor dining and mature planting creating a peaceful retreat. A convenient shared side entrance further enhances the practicality of the home.\r\n\r\nGlenageary Heights remains one of the area's most desirable residential private estate offering an exceptional balance of tranquility and convenience. Residents enjoy easy access to local shops, schools, churches, parks and a variety of sporting and leisure facilities. The popular and vibrant coastal villages of Dalkey, Glenageary, Glasthule, and Sandycove are all within easy reach offering an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, boutiques and scenic coastal walks. Excellent transport links including the DART and numerous Dublin Bus routes ensure swift access to Dublin City Centre, Dun Laoghaire and beyond.\r\n\r\n\r\nViewing is high recommended."
      },
      {
